---
---

<section id="operations" class="section-surface">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Operations</p>
      <h2>We handle more than the link.</h2>
      <p>
        The work can include rollout, billing, access management, monitoring, and support,
        depending on how the site needs to run.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="focus-grid">
      <article class="focus-item">
        <p class="focus-index">01</p>
        <h3>Hospitals and clinics</h3>
        <p>Reliable connectivity for clinical work, reporting, staff coordination, and core facility operations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="focus-item">
        <p class="focus-index">02</p>
        <h3>Businesses and institutions</h3>
        <p>Satellite-backed service, branch connectivity, billing workflows, and managed operations support.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="focus-item">
        <p class="focus-index">03</p>
        <h3>Remote and community sites</h3>
        <p>Deployments in underserved areas where the internet stack needs to be practical and self-sustaining.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Operations side-by-side with aligned image -->
    <div class="approach-grid">
      <div class="approach-copy-pane">
        <p class="eyebrow">What we handle</p>
        <h3>The operating layer stays with us.</h3>
        <p class="approach-intro-text">
          Instead of leaving you to manage the local distribution, user access, and satellite link
          accidents independently, we keep the entire site system under one support team.
        </p>
        <ul class="approach-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Site survey and mapping:</strong> Sizing links and defining coverage zones before shipping.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Equipment and edge routing:</strong> Placing robust routers and backup battery systems on site.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Facility-wide distribution:</strong> Laying indoor and outdoor cabling and access points.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Billing & monitoring integration:</strong> Handling billing rules and access flows directly.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Managed operations support:</strong> 24/7 remote monitoring and rapid local response.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="approach-image-pane">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092921461-eab62e97a780?w=1000&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Technical assembly and network operations engineering"
          class="approach-main-image"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Detailed operations steps -->
    <div class="approach-steps-section">
      <div class="approach-steps-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Operating layer</p>
        <h2>Planning, service control, and support stay connected.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="approach-stage-grid">
        <article class="approach-stage">
          <div class="approach-stage-top">
            <p class="approach-stage-index">01</p>
            <p class="approach-stage-label">Planning layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Plan the site</h3>
          <p>Review location, size the link, map coverage, and place equipment before deployment.</p>
          <div class="approach-stage-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Includes</span>
              <strong>Link sizing & coverage map</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Sets up</span>
              <strong>Deployment decisions</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="approach-stage">
          <div class="approach-stage-top">
            <p class="approach-stage-index">02</p>
            <p class="approach-stage-label">Service layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Run the service</h3>
          <p>Handle billing, access rules, accounts, and daily workflows as part of the operating stack.</p>
          <div class="approach-stage-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Handles</span>
              <strong>Accounts & access rules</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Keeps</span>
              <strong>Billing tied to live usage</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="approach-stage">
          <div class="approach-stage-top">
            <p class="approach-stage-index">03</p>
            <p class="approach-stage-label">Continuity layer</p>
          </div>
          <h3>Keep it reliable</h3>
          <p>Monitor the site, respond to issues, and support continuity once the network is live.</p>
          <div class="approach-stage-rows">
            <div>
              <span>Tracks</span>
              <strong>Service health & issues</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span>Protects</span>
              <strong>Day-to-day uptime</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="approach-summary">
        The network stays usable because the operating layer does not get left behind.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #operations {
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding-top: var(--space-96);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-96);
  }

  .focus-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-32);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-96);
  }

  .focus-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .focus-index,
  .approach-stage-index {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .focus-item h3,
  .approach-stage h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .focus-item p,
  .approach-stage p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Side-by-side Approach Section */
  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-48);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-96);
    padding-top: var(--space-48);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .approach-copy-pane {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .approach-copy-pane .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .approach-copy-pane h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .approach-intro-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-24);
  }

  .approach-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-16);
  }

  .approach-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--space-24);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .approach-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .approach-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .approach-image-pane {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-surface-strong);
  }

  .approach-main-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* Operations Steps Section */
  .approach-steps-section {
    padding-top: var(--space-48);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .approach-steps-header {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-48);
  }

  .approach-steps-header .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .approach-steps-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .approach-stage-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-24);
  }

  .approach-stage {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    min-height: 220px;
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .approach-stage-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .approach-stage-label {
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .approach-stage-rows {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .approach-stage-rows div {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .approach-stage-rows span {
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .approach-stage-rows strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .approach-summary {
    margin-top: var(--space-48);
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .focus-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .approach-stage-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .approach-stage-rows div {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-16);
    }

    .approach-stage-rows strong {
      text-align: right;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .approach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    }
  }
</style>
